<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-012" chapter-id="c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts" source-id="s-nanshi-012-jing-consorts-ws2060595">
  <p id="c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p001:m0000" ref="a9e_rqu_2cb">敬夏太后</persName>，會稽人也。普通中，納于湘東王宮，生<persName id="c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p001:m0022" ref="s14_u6j_1ek">敬帝</persName>。承聖元年冬，拜晉安王國太妃。紹泰元年，尊為太后。明年冬，降為江陰國太妃。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p002:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAFA">敬王皇后</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。承聖元年十一月，拜晉安王妃。紹泰元年十月，拜皇后。明年，降為江陰王妃。父<persName id="c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p002:m0048" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAF">僉</persName>自有傳。</p>
</text>
